224
00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:37.690
Strateegiline mõtlemine,
psühholoogia, muud nagu asjad.

225
00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:41.310
Lais silma ring,

226
00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:47.050
